            'If you are in a pool rather than answering one posting, you cannot mirror a single advert. You can still choose a lane: plant finance, B2B SaaS customer success, industrial sales in Anatolia. A lane is not a prison. It is what makes a thirty-second pass possible. People who write open to any challenge force the recruiter to invent a brief. Recruiters will invent one that matches yesterday’s search, which may not be you. Pick the work you would accept this quarter and let the file say it plainly.',
